{
  "info": {
    "name": "Cabinet Médical API",
    "description": "1) Lancer '0 - Authentification' > Login ADMIN (le jeton est enregistré). 2) Dossiers 1 à 5 = anciennes routes CRUD, réservées à l'ADMIN. 3) Pour tester un espace, se connecter avec le rôle voulu (le jeton est remplacé), puis lancer le dossier 7, 8 ou 9. Les ids supposent une base vide.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:8081/api"
    },
    {
      "key": "token",
      "value": ""
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "0 - Authentification",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Login ADMIN (stocke le jeton)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/login",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"admin@cabinet.tn\",\n  \"motDePasse\": \"Admin123!\"\n}"
            },
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('login ok', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('token', pm.response.json().token);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Inscription PATIENT (stocke le jeton)",
